From f2ca3dfd0e5c36774a2434e5606dbc07a77a9594 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kunati <itsmekunati@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:46:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] octet: update test sources for Octet address prefixes,
 magic, conf name and genesis time

Address literals (bech32 and base58) in unit/functional tests and test data are
rewritten to the Octet HRPs/prefixes with valid checksums, addr() descriptor
checksums recomputed, functional framework magic bytes, conf file name and
TIME_GENESIS_BLOCK updated. Deliberately-corrupted vectors (e.g.
rpc_invalid_address_message.py) are NOT regenerated.
